# <Your Fork> — fork overlay

> Bootstrap stub for a fork overlay. The base CLAUDE.md is upstream; this overlay
> carries fork-specific additions. Memnyx ships this stub empty.
>
> A fork's REAL overlay content belongs at the fork's repo root as `CLAUDE.fork.md`
> — outside `.claude/skills/`, so a skill sync never overwrites it. `/setup-workspace`
> renders that repo-root file into each workspace's `CLAUDE.fork.md`; this stub is
> only the fallback used to seed a workspace before the fork has authored its
> repo-root file. To adopt: replace `<Your Fork>` above, fill the sections below,
> and save this as `CLAUDE.fork.md` at your fork's repo root. Additive only —
> extends the base, never contradicts it.
>
> Note: `{{workspace_name}}` and `{{workspace_path}}` are substituted per-workspace
> when this file is deployed (same as the base template) — use them intentionally
> for workspace-specific text, and avoid the literal `{{…}}` tokens otherwise.

